      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BETTER NOT SLIP (6) resumes and appeals as the one to beat off her form and the form around her last time in. She has had a Doomben trial placing to prepare, and her last campaign included Listed Queensland Day Stakes exposure before a sound Doomben fourth when awkwardly away. CRYPTIC BEAUTY (1) is race-fit and comes off a BM65 second at Sunshine Coast, beaten a lip after fighting hard, with strong wet-track and distance credentials. CRYPTO MISS (4) is a genuine danger if she puts the Toowoomba mishap behind her, having lost the rider as favourite after knuckling on jumping, while her prior Eagle Farm fourth in a had merit given she raced wide. IDLEONBY (2) is also in the mix after running into the placings at Eagle Farm, where interference didn't stop her finishing hot on their heels. SUNSET ADIOS (10) progressed nicely off his maiden win with a strong closing effort here last time, just missing the bob. Still improving and has to be included.",
